[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3200781107","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109770#issuecomment-3200781107","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109770","id":3200781107,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-yAsz","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-19T13:30:42Z","updated_at":"2025-08-19T13:30:42Z","body":"I don't fully understand the issue this is fixing, and perhaps the PR needs more work based on the CI failures, but I do like that this adds the `(void)extra_rc;` at the end, to try and help ensure that we don't break this again in the future","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3200781107/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3201478331","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109770#issuecomment-3201478331","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109770","id":3201478331,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-0q67","user":{"login":"RandomShaper","id":11797174,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk3MTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11797174?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper","html_url":"https://github.com/RandomShaper","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-19T16:46:59Z","updated_at":"2025-08-19T16:52:01Z","body":"I was very surprised certain tests were failing and this is the explanation I finally figured out (PR updated to account for it):\r\n\r\nCertain classes (e.g., `BaseMaterial3D`) call `notify_property_list_changed()` within their constructor, which emits a signal. In case the object is purely `memnew`-ed, to be later assigned to a `Ref`, the mechanism to preserve such object until the end of signal emission would be the first to wrap it in a `Ref`. That was problematic, because by the time the constructor ended and the main code tried to assign to `Ref`, the reference count would already be zero with the init ref flag being unset as well.\r\n\r\nTherefore, I've updated the PR to account for that situation. I don't know why this sort of pathological case wasn't apparent before. It may be that the GLTF tests (the ones first triggering the issue) were written when the thread safe signals PR had already been merged (that's the PR inhibiting the logic of object preservation during signal). In any case, it all makes sense now and this PR does both restoring the functionality of the mechanism as well as preventing emissions from constructors to cause crashes.\r\n\r\nP. S.: @dsnopek, in the end I've had to delete the safety line because there's actual code there now. Thanks anyway for noticing!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3201478331/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3201752336","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109770#issuecomment-3201752336","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109770","id":3201752336,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-1t0Q","user":{"login":"RandomShaper","id":11797174,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk3MTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11797174?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper","html_url":"https://github.com/RandomShaper","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-19T18:24:13Z","updated_at":"2025-08-19T18:24:13Z","body":"The test cases involving materials seem fixed, but there are other failing ones. I'll keep digging.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3201752336/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3233161137","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109770#issuecomment-3233161137","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109770","id":3233161137,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Ath-x","user":{"login":"RandomShaper","id":11797174,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk3MTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11797174?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper","html_url":"https://github.com/RandomShaper","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-28T11:42:47Z","updated_at":"2025-08-28T11:45:54Z","body":"OK, fixed. The issue was that other tests were triggering the early return of `ERR_UNAVAILABLE` in `Object::emit_signalp`, which was making the pending unreference not to happen.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3233161137/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]